A JavaScript module isusually a file, but it can also bean HTML script.

A module fileis a .js file using import / export.

A module scriptis an HTML script using import / export.

Modules useexportandimportto interchange functionalities between modules.

An HTML script usingtype="module"is treated as a module:

### Code Examples

```
